                        "text": "var t=Math.min(1,Math.max(0,(time-151.15)/0.4));var s=t<0.6?(t/0.6)*115:115-(t-0.6)/0.4*15;s=s*100/100;var w=Math.min(1,Math.max(0,(time-161)/0.4));s=s*(1-w);[s,s];",
