                        "text": "var t=Math.min(1,Math.max(0,(time-3.0)/1.0));var e=t*t*(3-2*t);var hop=Math.sin(t*Math.PI)*160;var nod=(time>4)?Math.sin((time-4)*4.5)*Math.min(1,(time-4)/0.4):0;\nvar m=(time<3.0)?0:28;var sq=(time>4&&time<4.2)?Math.sin((time-4)/0.2*Math.PI)*0.08:0;var o1=Math.min(1,Math.max(0,(time-85.6)/0.4));var i1=Math.min(1,Math.max(0,(time-136)/0.45));var hide=(time<136)?(1-o1):(i1<0.6?(i1/0.6)*1.15:1.15-(i1-0.6)/0.4*0.15);m=m*hide;[m*(1+sq)*(1-0.01*nod),m*(1-sq)*(1+0.03*nod)];",
